1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,200
To change a bicycle tire,

2
00:00:02,200 --> 00:00:05,160
first release the brake and remove the wheel.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,120
Use two levers to lift the tire

4
00:00:07,120 --> 00:00:08,680
off the rim.

5
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,160
Pull out the old tube,

6
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,380
check the tire for sharp objects,

7
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:14,140
then fit the new tube and pump

8
00:00:14,140 --> 00:00:15,131
it up slowly.
